  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats are made with high-density TPE material, using advanced 3D laser technology, which not only provides a superb feel and extreme wear resistance but also offers a precise fit to your vehicle floor.\nFitment\n2022-2026 Honda Civic Sedan Only(Not for Hatchback)\nDoes not fit vehicles with vinyl flooring,only for carpet flooring.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: YITAMOTOR Honda Civic Sedan floor mats 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 (Not for Hatchback) use State-of-the-art 3D laser scanning technology ensures the perfect custom fit for your Civic. Civic floor liners are precisely tailored for your vehicle-specific floor carpets\nHigh Durability: Floor mats Honda Civic 2026 2025 2024 2023 2022 made from TPE material, offer comfort and wear resistance; Flexible in extreme temperatures; Does not contain latex, cadmium, lead, or harmful PVC\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: Civic all-weather floor mats with unique channels and raised edges trap liquids, debris, and dirt, keeping car and shoes clean; Built-in clips ensure a firm grip and prevent slipping when wet\nEasy To Clean: The Honda Civic floor mats simply shake the dirt out of the textured skid-resistant surface or spray down with a hose; Cleaning up daily wear and tear off our Civic car mats is a breeze\nWhy Choose YITAMOTOR: Our 2022-2026 honda civic Sedan rubber car mats are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard to your vehicle",
